8 0 obj
<< /Length 700 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 720 Td (National Digital Identity Gateway #401) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 700 Td (What A single sign-on national digital ID authentication gateway for accessing all government online services.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 680 Td (Why Eliminates multiple logins, secures citizen personal data, and streamlines cross-agency service delivery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 660 Td (How? Indicative Steps: 1. Check for single citizen login portal. Criteria for Yes: Centralized identity provider \(eID/SSO\) available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 640 Td (Case Examples Estonia e-Residency/Smart-ID, Singapore Singpass, UK GOV.UK One Login.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 620 Td (Check out https://singpass.gov.sg) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
9 0 obj
<< /Length 712 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 720 Td (Centralized Public e-Procurement Portal #402) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 700 Td (What A national electronic portal publishing all government tender notices, bids, award notices, and contract values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 680 Td (Why Promotes fair market competition, prevents corruption, and provides transparency in public spending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 660 Td (How? Indicative Steps: 1. Search national e-procurement portal. Criteria for Yes: Open tender listings and contract award publications found.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 640 Td (Case Examples South Korea KONEPS, ChileCompra, UK Contracts Finder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 620 Td (Check out https://contractsfinder.service.gov.uk) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Length 697 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 720 Td (National Open Government Data Catalog #403) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 700 Td (What A centralized national data repository offering public sector datasets in machine-readable open formats \(CSV, JSON, XML\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 680 Td (Why Stimulates economic innovation, academic research, and public accountability through open data access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 660 Td (How? Indicative Steps: 1. Navigate to open data portal. Criteria for Yes: Searchable dataset catalog with direct download links.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 640 Td (Case Examples Data.gov \(USA\), Data.gov.uk \(UK\), Data.gouv.fr \(France\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 620 Td (Check out https://data.gov) Tj ET
endstream
